{"ID":"20260205093254-l0isj80","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-l0isj80","title":"6_VGGNet","type":"doc","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260205093254-emx8l4w","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-emx8l4w","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"# "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"结构上的无敌优化"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"VGGNet"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-dx0uo73","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-dx0uo73","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e "},{"ID":"20260205093254-9csg9k1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-9csg9k1","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"[!NOTE]"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-12uweu4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-12uweu4","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"VGGNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Karen Simonyan"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等人在ImageNet大赛上获奖并于2015年在论文"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"VERY DEEP CONVOLUTIONAL NETWORKS FOR LARGE-SCALE IMAGE RECOGNITION"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中提出的网络架构。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-41accju","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-41accju","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个网络结构主要是用于大规模图像识别的一种极深的卷积神经网络。是当时最最最深的神经网络结构，同时也是计算量最大的一种网络结构。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-fkcxgqu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-fkcxgqu","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我认为就是该网络引领了后面大家向着更多深度的网络迈进，也是深度方面的鼻祖性神经网络结构。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-n66m7du","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-n66m7du","updated":"20260205093254"}},{"ID":"20260205093254-6qadbbp","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-6qadbbp","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1 模型背景"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-kcphm5i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-kcphm5i","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在该模型提出的早期有一个颠覆性的神经网络模型"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"AlexNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"产出来了，当时基本上所有的网络都是在对"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"AlexNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"架构进行改进，当然"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"VGGNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"也是如此。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-dzalvli","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-dzalvli","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在VGGNet产生之前，有许多的学者在AlexNet的基础上采用卷积层更小的核心以及更小的步幅获得了非常好的效果；还有一些人是对整个网络的模型结构上深度也获得了不错的改进。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-gwn62b5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-gwn62b5","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那么这两种方法都可行的话，可以不可以将他们二者合二为一呢，搞一个卷积核很小并且深度特别深的网络结构呢？当然"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"VGGNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"也就孕育而生了。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-azcoe29","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-azcoe29","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"VGGNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"网络结构是非常的简单的，他的整体都采用很小的卷积核对每一层都是特别小的那种卷积核，并且每一层卷积的卷积核完全相同。此外猛拉网络深度，达到了惊人的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"16-19"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"层。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-dk3w4yi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-dk3w4yi","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeImage","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260120144348227"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/3693258/202601/3693258-20260120144354285-2009979555.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-ccqlml4","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-ccqlml4","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e "},{"ID":"20260205093254-9r5s9it","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-9r5s9it","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不要认为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"16-19"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"层非常的浅，实际上这个深度是很深很深的，哪怕是16层的网络结构他的参数也已经达到了惊人的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"1330000000一亿三千三百万"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"！"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-4cx65df","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-4cx65df","updated":"20260205093254"}},{"ID":"20260205093254-9xc2fnb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-9xc2fnb","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2 模型架构"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-1o160he","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-1o160he","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"VGGNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"总共有六种网络结构分别命名为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"A，ALRn，B，C，D，E"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，网络的深度从左到右逐级递增。最后一种结构的深度为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"19"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"层。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-595sua6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-595sua6","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"VGGNet整体采用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"3\\times 3"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大小的卷积核进行每一次卷积操作，同时卷积的步长"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Stride=1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，卷积过程中的填充"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Padding=1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。对于这个数据我们稍微做一下计算。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-pu5yd06","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-pu5yd06","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"假设输入的图片大小为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"H\\times W"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，卷积核的大小为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"K\\times K"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，卷积过程中的步长"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"Stride=S"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，卷积过程中的填充"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"Padding=P"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，输出的图片大小为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"H'\\times W'"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-r6syy7u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-r6syy7u","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那么就有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"H' = \\frac{H+2P-K}{2} +1 ; W' = \\frac{W+2P-K}{2}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeSoftBreak","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"将数据带入就有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"H' = \\frac{H+2-1}{2} +1=H ; W' = \\frac{W+2-1}{2}=W"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。发现卷积前后的图片尺寸并无变化。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-eud84vu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-eud84vu","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"VGG"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"网络中卷积后的下一步操作是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"ReLU"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个就是一种激活函数。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-h468sdv","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-h468sdv","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e "},{"ID":"20260205093254-j9e6ta2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-j9e6ta2","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"AlexNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中已经有过介绍了"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-21s5l6o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-21s5l6o","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最后一步就是最大池化，并且池化的参数也是固定的参数，一般是令池化的核心数量为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"2\\times 2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，池化的步长为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这么一来每次池化后的大小均是原来图像大小的一半。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-7ht45vn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-7ht45vn","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"VGGNet就是这样子一块一块的叠加，每一块都是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Conv+ReLU+MaxPool"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的集合。我们将这个集合称为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"VGG块"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，每次图片经过"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"VGG块"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"之后他的图像尺寸就会缩小一倍，也就是长宽各变成原来的一半大小，那么如此有规律的运作就使得我们在进行深度叠加的时候变得更加的简洁。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-2s5f74k","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-2s5f74k","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e "},{"ID":"20260205093254-n41bs83","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-n41bs83","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个块儿的思路我觉得是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"VGG"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"网络最大的创新点"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-e8yqeua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-e8yqeua","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在就给出原文的具体的六种网络结构。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-sv0m89p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-sv0m89p","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeImage","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang","Data":"!"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket","Data":"["},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260120150634547"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket","Data":"]"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen","Data":"("},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/3693258/202601/3693258-20260120150657716-1685084904.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen","Data":")"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-fk4k4k5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-fk4k4k5","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他的每一列都是一种类型的网络。"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-btolru2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-btolru2","updated":"20260205093254"}},{"ID":"20260205093254-pyjhs5n","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-pyjhs5n","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3 模型代码框架"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-swpyuqk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-swpyuqk","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"VGG"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"-A网络结构为重要的例子进行阐述，下面是VGG-A的整体结构图。应该是比较清晰的"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-cplz1tb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-cplz1tb","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeImage","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang","Data":"!"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket","Data":"["},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image-20260120151713687"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket","Data":"]"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen","Data":"("},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"https://img2024.cnblogs.com/blog/3693258/202601/3693258-20260120151723478-56255939.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen","Data":")"}]}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-pj3ms1e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-pj3ms1e","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"然后给出"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"VGG-A"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的代码"}]},{"ID":"20260205093254-e9tahyh","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockInfo":"cHl0aG9u","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260205093254-e9tahyh","updated":"20260205093254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"cHl0aG9u"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"import torch\nimport torch.nn as nn\n\nclass VGGNetA(nn.Module):\n    '''VGGNetA模型定义\n    '''\n    def __init__(self , num_classes = 10):\n        super(VGGNetA , self).__init__()\n        # input size = [3 , 224 , 224]\n        self.conv1 = nn.Conv2d(3 , 64 , kernel_size = 3 , padding= 1)\n        self.relu1 = nn.ReLU()\n        self.maxpool1 = nn.MaxPool2d(kernel_size=2 , stride=2)\n\n        # input size = [64 , 112 , 112]\n        self.conv2 = nn.Conv2d(64 , 128 , kernel_size = 3 , padding= 1)\n        self.relu2 = nn.ReLU()\n        self.maxpool2 = nn.MaxPool2d(kernel_size=2 , stride=2)\n\n        # input size = [128 , 56 , 56]\n        self.conv3 = nn.Conv2d(128 , 256 , kernel_size = 3 , padding= 1)\n        self.relu3 = nn.ReLU()\n        self.conv4 = nn.Conv2d(256 , 256 , kernel_size = 3 , padding= 1)\n        self.relu4 = nn.ReLU()\n        self.maxpool3 = nn.MaxPool2d(kernel_size=2 , stride=2)\n\n        # input size = [256 , 28 , 28]\n        self.conv5 = nn.Conv2d(256 , 512 , kernel_size = 3 , padding= 1)\n        self.relu5 = nn.ReLU()\n        self.conv6 = nn.Conv2d(512 , 512 , kernel_size = 3 , padding= 1)\n        self.relu6 = nn.ReLU()\n        self.maxpool4 = nn.MaxPool2d(kernel_size=2 , stride=2)  \n\n        # input size = [512 , 14 , 14]\n        self.conv7 = nn.Conv2d(512 , 512 , kernel_size = 3 , padding= 1)\n        self.relu7 = nn.ReLU()\n        self.conv8 = nn.Conv2d(512 , 512 , kernel_size = 3 , padding= 1)\n        self.relu8 = nn.ReLU()\n        self.maxpool5 = nn.MaxPool2d(kernel_size=2 , stride=2)\n\n        # input size = [512 , 7 , 7]\n        self.fc1 = nn.Linear(in_features=25088 ,out_features=4096 , bias=True)\n        self.relu9 = nn.ReLU()\n        \n        self.fc2 = nn.Linear(in_features=4096 , out_features=4096 , bias=True)\n        self.relu10 = nn.ReLU()\n\n        self.fc3 = nn.Linear(in_features=4096 , out_features=1000 , bias= True)\n    \n    def forward(self , x):\n        x = self.conv1(x)\n        x = self.relu1(x)\n        x = self.maxpool1(x)\n        x = self.conv2(x)\n        x = self.relu2(x)\n        x = self.maxpool2(x)\n        x = self.conv3(x)\n        x = self.relu3(x)\n        x = self.conv4(x)\n        x = self.relu4(x)\n        x = self.maxpool3(x)\n        x = self.conv5(x)\n        x = self.relu5(x)\n        x = self.conv6(x)\n        x = self.relu6(x)\n        x = self.maxpool4(x)\n        x = self.conv7(x)\n        x = self.relu7(x)\n        x = self.conv8(x)\n        x = self.relu8(x)\n        x = self.maxpool5(x)\n        x = x.view(x.size(0), -1)\n        x = self.fc1(x)\n        x = self.relu9(x)\n        x = self.fc2(x)\n        x = self.relu10(x)\n        x = self.fc3(x)\n        return x\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]}]}